    "learnings": {
      "repo": [
        "AGENTS.md requires filling lines to 120 columns (.rustfmt.toml), but rustfmt does not reflow inside `matches!`, so `just lint` may not catch over-long lines there.",
        "AGENTS.md rule 6: always emit a Diagnostic when degrading or skipping a component, rather than silently dropping it.",
