        "`(forwardRef as forwardRefType)` appears at 97 sites in react-spectrum, so the extractor's callee-name handling must keep working for it.",
        "Work happens in a git worktree under .claude/worktrees/, and dependabot branches carry the PR."
      ],
      "code": [
        {
          "path": "crates/core/src/extractor/component.rs",
          "line": 140,
          "finding": "`names_its_result` only accepts a type reference or a function type returning one, so `typeof X` for a different expression and similar casts count as replaced identity and the callee is dropped silently."
        },
        {
          "path": "crates/core/src/extractor/component.rs",
          "line": 262,
          "finding": "`peel` sets `asserted = true` for every assertion, including identity-keeping ones (`typeof f`, `any`, `unknown`), so type arguments under such a cast are lost."
        },
        {
          "path": "crates/core/src/extractor/component.rs",
          "line": 102,
          "finding": "`peel_expr` stops at `TSInstantiationExpression`, so init-position callers treat `Base<P>` as a non-component while callee-position `peel` and `call_type_arguments` handle it."
        },
        {
          "path": "crates/core/src/extractor/mod.rs",
          "line": 1312,
          "finding": "`expression_to_ident_name` now routes through `component::named`, changing output strings for all callers (extends target, member object names, callee names) when casts are present."
        },
        {
          "path": "crates/core/src/extractor/interface.rs",
          "line": 409,
          "finding": "`scan_object_assign_call` takes its parent from `aliased_component(call)` instead of requiring `Argument::Identifier`, so wrapped parents like `Object.assign(Root as any, {...})` now attach inline members."
        },
        {
          "path": "crates/core/src/extractor/component.rs",
          "line": 224,
          "finding": "`assertion_keeps_identity` re-peels at each assertion level and several helpers re-run the full peel for the same callee, which is quadratic for nested casts in a hot rayon path."
        }
      ],
